  },
  {
   "idx": 5,
   "zh": "今天，金砖国家领导人举行线上峰会，就当前国际形势和共同关心的问题深入交换意见，具有重要意义。",
   "en": "It is very relevant that we BRICS leaders have this virtual summit today to discuss thoroughly the current international situation and issues of common interest.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    9,
    9
   ],
